Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.02,0:01:27.06,Logo,,0,0,0,,Dera-chan, try some kashiwamochi.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.02,0:01:27.06,Logo,,0,0,0,,It's Boys' Day today!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.06,0:01:27.10,Logo,,0,0,0,,Dera-chan, I made some jam kashiwamochi as an experiment!
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.06,0:01:27.10,Logo,,0,0,0,,Dera-chan, I made some chocolate kashiwamochi too. Try them!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.06,0:01:27.10,Logo,,0,0,0,,I can't move...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.06,0:01:27.10,Logo,,0,0,0,,You must be really stupid.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.06,0:01:27.10,Logo,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.06,0:01:27.10,Logo,,0,0,0,,How dare you mock me, little girl—
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.06,0:01:27.10,Logo,,0,0,0,,You don't have to eat {\bord11.09\blur0.71\fs8\fscy1108.92\fscx1108.92\alpha&H00&\c&HFEFEFE&\3c&H9D54E9&\pos(888.92,540.57)}everything{\c&HB6FFFD&} she gives you.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.06,0:01:27.10,Logo,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't mean to, but...
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.10,0:01:27.15,Logo,,0,0,0,,whenever that girl gives me anything, before I realize it...
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.10,0:01:27.15,Logo,,0,0,0,,So, how many did you eat?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.10,0:01:27.15,Logo,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.10,0:01:27.15,Logo,,0,0,0,,I'm not the type to dwell on the small stuff.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.10,0:01:27.15,Logo,,0,0,0,,So you don't remember?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.10,0:01:27.15,Logo,,0,0,0,,Are you a chicken?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.10,0:01:27.15,Logo,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.10,0:01:27.15,Logo,,0,0,0,,How dare you lump me with that livestock?!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.15,0:01:27.19,Logo,,0,0,0,,You're close enough.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.15,0:01:27.19,Logo,,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.15,0:01:27.19,Logo,,0,0,0,,If you keep doing whatever {\bord9.06\blur0.71\fs7\fscy1007.22\fscx1007.22\alpha&H00&\c&HFEFEFE&\pos(465.95,283.43)\3c&H9D54E9&}Onee-chan says, you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.15,0:01:27.19,Logo,,0,0,0,,She's seriously empty headed.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.15,0:01:27.19,Logo,,0,0,0,,Hey now, don't speak of your sister like that.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.15,0:01:27.19,Logo,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear that from an overeating, obese bird.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.15,0:01:27.19,Logo,,0,0,0,,Sure, you little runt.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.15,0:01:27.19,Logo,,0,0,0,,There it is again.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.19,0:01:27.23,Logo,,0,0,0,,What is this sound?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.19,0:01:27.23,Logo,,0,0,0,,Taiko drums.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.19,0:01:27.23,Logo,,0,0,0,,The festival's coming up soon.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.19,0:01:27.23,Logo,,0,0,0,,A festival?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.19,0:01:27.23,Logo,,0,0,0,,Carnival!
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.19,0:01:27.23,Logo,,0,0,0,,Do you have to do that every time?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.19,0:01:27.23,Logo,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.19,0:01:27.23,Logo,,0,0,0,,The hearts of young girls grow soft and love fills the air at a carnival!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.23,0:01:27.27,Logo,,0,0,0,,This is an opportunity!
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.23,0:01:27.27,Logo,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, my prince's bride!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.23,0:01:27.27,Logo,,0,0,0,,The sweet, fragrant air of early summer.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.23,0:01:27.27,Logo,,0,0,0,,The season for festivals.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.23,0:01:27.27,Logo,,0,0,0,,Love I may find as their hearts dance.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.23,0:01:27.27,Logo,,0,0,0,,I must go, to find my prince's bride.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.23,0:01:27.27,Logo,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.23,0:01:27.27,Logo,,0,0,0,,An, lend me a hand.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.27,0:01:27.31,Logo,,0,0,0,,Why are you so full of yourself?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.27,0:01:27.31,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.54\blur4.02\fs7\fscy1005.88\fscx1005.88\alpha&H00&\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\pos(468.1,286.67)}Episode
