Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.31,0:01:27.35,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fs7\fscy1005.41\fscx1005.41\alpha&H00&\c&HFEFEFE&\pos(466.26,283.57)}Good-bye {\c&HFEFEFE&}Stomach
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.31,0:01:27.35,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.02\fs8\fscy1105.95\fscx1105.95\alpha&H00&\c&H000000&\pos(889.25,544.11)}Good-bye @@KEEP1@@Stomach
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.31,0:01:27.35,Logo,,0,0,0,,It's so bitter...
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.31,0:01:27.35,Logo,,0,0,0,,Put up with it.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.31,0:01:27.35,Logo,,0,0,0,,How could a bird eat so much kashiwamochi?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.35,0:01:27.40,Logo,,0,0,0,,Well, it's good that he's energetic.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.35,0:01:27.40,Logo,,0,0,0,,Why would Dera need to be energetic?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.35,0:01:27.40,Logo,,0,0,0,,And Onee-chan said {\bord9.04\blur0.7\fs7\fscy1004.94\fscx1004.94\alpha&H00&\c&HFEFEFE&\pos(466.34,283.61)\3c&H9D54E9&}she'd{\c&HFEFEFE&} keep you.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.35,0:01:27.40,Logo,,0,0,0,,Why don't you sleep in her room?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.35,0:01:27.40,Logo,,0,0,0,,"Keep" me?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.35,0:01:27.40,Logo,,0,0,0,,I am no pet!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.35,0:01:27.40,Logo,,0,0,0,,I am staying here at her request.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.35,0:01:27.40,Logo,,0,0,0,,Why is he so full of himself?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.40,0:01:27.44,Logo,,0,0,0,,Maybe because he can talk?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.40,0:01:27.44,Logo,,0,0,0,,You're just too kind, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.40,0:01:27.44,Logo,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can feel it working!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.40,0:01:27.44,Logo,,0,0,0,,Good-bye indigestion! Good-bye pain!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.40,0:01:27.44,Logo,,0,0,0,,Now to search for my prince's bride!
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.40,0:01:27.44,Logo,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.40,0:01:27.44,Logo,,0,0,0,,How strange. I had no intention of landing here.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.40,0:01:27.44,Logo,,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.44,0:01:27.48,Logo,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, Anko!
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.44,0:01:27.48,Logo,,0,0,0,,"An"!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.44,0:01:27.48,Logo,,0,0,0,,I keep telling you to call me An!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.44,0:01:27.48,Logo,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that for the festival?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.44,0:01:27.48,Logo,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Isn't it cute?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.44,0:01:27.48,Logo,,0,0,0,,We're getting new stuff because the district had some extra money this year, right?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.44,0:01:27.48,Logo,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, Dad. Thanks.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.44,0:01:27.48,Logo,,0,0,0,,And look!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.48,0:01:27.52,Logo,,0,0,0,,Bunny Mountain
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.48,0:01:27.52,Logo,,0,0,0,,Bunny Mountain Shopping District!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.48,0:01:27.52,Logo,,0,0,0,,Is that really that cute?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.48,0:01:27.52,Logo,,0,0,0,,We won't lose against any other districts with this!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.48,0:01:27.52,Logo,,0,0,0,,We got one for you too, Anko.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.48,0:01:27.52,Logo,,0,0,0,,Want to try it on?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.48,0:01:27.52,Logo,,0,0,0,,Call me An!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.48,0:01:27.52,Logo,,0,0,0,,And I have to go to school now, so no.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.52,0:01:27.56,Logo,,0,0,0,,Don't you like the festival?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.52,0:01:27.56,Logo,,0,0,0,,I like it, but...
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.52,0:01:27.56,Logo,,0,0,0,,You feel heavier than usual.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.52,0:01:27.56,Logo,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll go lighten myself up.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.52,0:01:27.56,Logo,,0,0,0,,We're off!
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.52,0:01:27.56,Logo,,0,0,0,,How about now?
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.52,0:01:27.56,Logo,,0,0,0,,You're about as heavy as normal again.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.52,0:01:27.56,Logo,,0,0,0,,People need smooth stomachs and smooth bowels.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.56,0:01:27.60,Logo,,0,0,0,,You're a bird.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.56,0:01:27.60,Logo,,0,0,0,,Silence, An!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.56,0:01:27.60,Logo,,0,0,0,,Unlike your typical bird, I possess a noble soul.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.56,0:01:27.60,Logo,,0,0,0,,Now I must search for my prince's bride!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.56,0:01:27.60,Logo,,0,0,0,,How long is he going to stick around?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.56,0:01:27.60,Logo,,0,0,0,,Hey, morning!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:27.56,0:01:27.60,Logo,,0,0,0,,Ooh, you're looking sharp today!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:27.56,0:01:27.60,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.7\fs8\fscy1102.98\fscx1102.98\alpha&H00&\c&HFEFEFE&\pos(887.58,539.61)}Bunny Mountain
