Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.61,0:02:24.80,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\k40}{\k18}{\be2\fad(150,150)}ki{\k15}ra{\k16}me{\k32}ku {\k21}ba{\k19}sho {\k70}ne {\k20}ko{\k18}ko {\k50}wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.61,0:02:24.80,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Isn't this place so bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:29.20,OP-Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}{\k20}ta{\k30}shi{\k22}ka{\k32}me{\k76}te{\k67}i{\k193}te
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:29.20,OP-TL,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fad(150,150)}Come in and take a look!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:40.19,0:02:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera-chan, try some kashiwamochi.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:42.52,0:02:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Boys' Day today!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:44.51,0:02:48.23,Top,,0,0,0,,Dera-chan, I made some jam kashiwamochi as an experiment!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:48.23,0:02:51.60,Top,,0,0,0,,Dera-chan, I made some chocolate kashiwamochi too. Try them!
Dialogue: 9,0:02:53.69,0:02:54.61,Top,,0,0,0,,I can't move...
Dialogue: 9,0:02:54.61,0:02:56.78,Top,,0,0,0,,You must be really stupid.
Dialogue: 9,0:02:57.19,0:02:58.56,Top,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 9,0:02:59.09,0:03:03.62,Top,,0,0,0,,How dare you mock me, little girl—
Dialogue: 9,0:03:03.62,0:03:07.52,Top,,0,0,0,,You don't have to eat {\i1}everything{\i0} she gives you.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:07.52,0:03:11.58,Top,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't mean to, but...
Dialogue: 9,0:03:11.58,0:03:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,whenever that girl gives me anything, before I realize it...
Dialogue: 9,0:03:14.88,0:03:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how many did you eat?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:16.13,0:03:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:17.50,0:03:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the type to dwell on the small stuff.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:21.63,0:03:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So you don't remember?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:23.60,0:03:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a chicken?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:24.47,0:03:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:25.82,0:03:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you lump me with that livestock?!
Dialogue: 9,0:03:28.06,0:03:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're close enough.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:29.98,0:03:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:31.71,0:03:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep doing whatever \NOnee-chan says, you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:36.04,0:03:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's seriously empty headed.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:38.56,0:03:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, don't speak of your sister like that.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:42.45,0:03:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear that from an overeating, obese bird.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:46.09,0:03:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you little runt.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:52.11,0:03:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is again.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:53.16,0:03:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this sound?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:54.82,0:03:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Taiko drums.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:55.90,0:03:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The festival's coming up soon.
Dialogue: 9,0:03:57.50,0:03:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A festival?
Dialogue: 9,0:03:58.98,0:04:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Carnival!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:00.17,0:04:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have to do that every time?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:02.50,0:04:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:03.64,0:04:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The hearts of young girls grow soft and love fills the air at a carnival!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:09.57,0:04:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an opportunity!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:10.96,0:04:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, my prince's bride!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:13.44,0:04:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The sweet, fragrant air of early summer.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:14.81,0:04:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The season for festivals.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:16.40,0:04:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Love I may find as their hearts dance.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:18.52,0:04:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I must go, to find my prince's bride.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:23.21,0:04:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:24.64,0:04:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,An, lend me a hand.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:26.52,0:04:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so full of yourself?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.45,0:04:33.41,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(530,0)\fax-0.06\fs50\bord3\blur4\3c&HB389F2&\pos(639,282)}Episode
