Dialogue: 2,0:04:33.41,0:04:34.54,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fs48\fn#44 Font\c&HC64C3C&\frz10.69\pos(475.2,678)}Good-bye \NStomach
Dialogue: 9,0:04:33.83,0:04:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so bitter...
Dialogue: 9,0:04:35.67,0:04:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Put up with it.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:37.44,0:04:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How could a bird eat so much kashiwamochi?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:39.96,0:04:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's good that he's energetic.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:43.12,0:04:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would Dera need to be energetic?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:46.26,0:04:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And Onee-chan said {\i1}she'd{\i0} keep you.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:49.20,0:04:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you sleep in her room?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:50.77,0:04:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"Keep" me?
Dialogue: 9,0:04:52.10,0:04:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I am no pet!
Dialogue: 9,0:04:53.25,0:04:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I am staying here at her request.
Dialogue: 9,0:04:57.79,0:05:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he so full of himself?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:00.26,0:05:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe because he can talk?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:02.45,0:05:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just too kind, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:04.95,0:05:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can feel it working!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:07.38,0:05:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Good-bye indigestion! Good-bye pain!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:10.48,0:05:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to search for my prince's bride!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:13.10,0:05:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:13.96,0:05:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange. I had no intention of landing here.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:18.88,0:05:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:20.33,0:05:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, Anko!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:21.92,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"An"!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:22.88,0:05:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep telling you to call me An!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:24.90,0:05:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that for the festival?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:26.68,0:05:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! Isn't it cute?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:28.97,0:05:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting new stuff because the district had some extra money this year, right?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:34.02,0:05:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, Dad. Thanks.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:36.75,0:05:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:40.11,Top,,0,0,30,,Bunny Mountain
Dialogue: 9,0:05:38.60,0:05:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunny Mountain Shopping District!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:40.85,0:05:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really that cute?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:42.32,0:05:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't lose against any other districts with this!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:46.72,0:05:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We got one for you too, Anko.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:48.02,0:05:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to try it on?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:48.78,0:05:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me An!
Dialogue: 9,0:05:50.64,0:05:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have to go to school now, so no.
Dialogue: 9,0:05:54.09,0:05:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you like the festival?
Dialogue: 9,0:05:56.16,0:05:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it, but...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:00.43,0:06:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You feel heavier than usual.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:01.88,0:06:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'll go lighten myself up.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:05.80,0:06:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're off!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:07.41,0:06:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How about now?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:09.49,0:06:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about as heavy as normal again.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:11.46,0:06:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,People need smooth stomachs and smooth bowels.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:15.10,0:06:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a bird.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:16.00,0:06:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, An!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:17.32,0:06:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike your typical bird, I possess a noble soul.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:21.84,0:06:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must search for my prince's bride!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:25.23,0:06:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How long is he going to stick around?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:26.80,0:06:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, morning!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:29.19,0:06:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, you're looking sharp today!
