Dialogue: 9,0:06:32.16,0:06:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Não acha?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:33.94,0:06:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,E quanto às faixas para este ano?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:36.74,0:06:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece totalmente a Bunny Mountain, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:06:38.53,0:06:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Uau! Essas orelhas são tão fofas!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:41.62,0:06:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fofo? Isso é nojento.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:43.17,0:06:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,O que você disse?!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:44.34,0:06:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Lá vamos nós de novo.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:46.01,0:06:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Você tá passando vergonha, velho.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:47.03,0:06:48.44,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Anko}Vou indo na frente.
Dialogue: 9,0:06:47.96,0:06:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Quem tá chamando quem de velho?!
Dialogue: 9,0:06:55.55,0:06:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Todo mundo animado pro festival...
Dialogue: 9,0:06:58.19,0:07:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Anko-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:00.73,0:07:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Temos croquetes fresquinhos.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:02.22,0:07:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Leve uns com você.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:04.13,0:07:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou pra escola agora, então...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:05.52,0:07:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá quase na hora do festival!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:08.86,0:07:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Anko-chan, quer um pouco de okara?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:10.74,0:07:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:11.18,0:07:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Chegaram anchovas boas hoje!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:13.83,0:07:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também tenho que ir pra escola agora...
Dialogue: 9,0:07:17.21,0:07:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Dá pros seus amigos. Eles vão adorar.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:20.20,0:07:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Que vergonha!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:21.74,0:07:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:22.60,0:07:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:24.67,0:07:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, bom dia.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:26.22,0:07:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia, Tama-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:27.84,0:07:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko, você fez a lição?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:30.16,0:07:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente não teve.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,E você, Midori-chan, fez a sua?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:33.44,0:07:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Também não tivemos!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:35.39,0:07:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Me chama de An, não de Anko!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:38.61,0:07:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,An?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:39.28,0:07:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, ela só tá dizendo isso.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:41.44,0:07:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não gosta de "Anko" porque é simples demais.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:45.29,0:07:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas é tão fofo!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:46.84,0:07:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem um jeitinho de mochi. É ótimo!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:49.44,0:07:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Por isso que eu não gosto!
Dialogue: 9,0:07:51.31,0:07:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,''Kanna'' também é simples demais pra filha de um carpinteiro?
Dialogue: 9,0:07:54.94,0:07:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,E o Ooji? {\i1}Mochi{\i0}zou.
Dialogue: 9,0:07:58.74,0:08:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, então ninguém descobriu a verdade ainda?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:02.26,0:08:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,É! Por isso é tão interessante!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:03.43,0:08:04.96,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{Anko}Ele tá vindo pra cá!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:04.96,0:08:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:05.58,0:08:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{Tamako}O quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:06.16,0:08:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{Anko}Shh!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:09.71,0:08:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tô ansiosa pela próxima aula em grupo. {グループ?}
Dialogue: 9,0:08:12.30,0:08:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, aquilo?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:12.89,0:08:13.68,Alternative,,0,0,0,,O que houve?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:13.68,0:08:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos fazer isso juntos também!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:16.61,0:08:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:18.54,0:08:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquem quietos!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:19.90,0:08:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou indo agora.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:22.01,0:08:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode ficar com isso.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:24.81,0:08:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Fico me perguntando o que houve...
Dialogue: 9,0:08:25.88,0:08:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah. Será que...
Dialogue: 9,0:08:27.50,0:08:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Viu? Meio legal, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:29.69,0:08:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é legal?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:31.31,0:08:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom, meio que é um alívio você ser tão avoado.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:34.78,0:08:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:35.86,0:08:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:37.83,0:08:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, entendi! Eles são inimigos!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:39.70,0:08:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos nos atrasar.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:42.11,0:08:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Me espera!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:46.55,0:08:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Quase bati com ele hoje de manhã...
Dialogue: 9,0:08:48.46,0:08:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia!
Dialogue: 9,0:08:50.05,0:08:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,O que houve?
Dialogue: 9,0:08:51.83,0:08:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? N-Nada.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:53.40,0:08:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 9,0:08:54.53,0:09:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, você foi pra casa antes da gente ontem, então não ouviu sobre o museu, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:01.23,0:09:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:02.21,0:09:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lembra quando a professora disse que devíamos ver sobre ir ao museu?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:08.06,0:09:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A gente tava falando de ir juntos.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:11.39,0:09:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:12.60,0:09:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Por enquanto, somos eu, Momiji-chan, Yuuko-chan,
Dialogue: 9,0:09:15.86,0:09:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,e o Tatsuya-kun e o Yuzuki-kun!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:18.03,0:09:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:18.86,0:09:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vem também, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:21.53,0:09:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sim.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:23.45,0:09:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsuya-kun! A Anko-chan disse que vem também!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:26.99,0:09:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:28.06,0:09:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,De qualquer forma, nos encontramos domingo que vem na frente da escola.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:32.55,0:09:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Domingo que vem?
Dialogue: 9,0:09:35.63,0:09:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:36.59,0:09:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:38.39,0:09:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quase não conseguimos no ano passado.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:41.44,0:09:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,E esse ano temos ainda mais encomendas.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:43.98,0:09:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas a Onee-chan tá ajudando!
Dialogue: 9,0:09:46.39,0:09:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Você também é filha de quem faz mochi, sabia.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:49.77,0:09:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é que eu quisesse...
Dialogue: 9,0:09:51.69,0:09:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,De qualquer jeito, você vai ajudar na loja no domingo.
Dialogue: 9,0:09:55.62,0:09:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Se quiser ir ao museu, eu te levo na semana seguinte.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:00.87,0:10:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Que graça tem ir ao museu com você?!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:04.12,0:10:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Nada feito. Não é não.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:06.51,0:10:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanto faz!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:10.04,0:10:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Consigo te ver.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:17.05,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fay0.29\fry30\fs30\fnIwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B\c&H76869C&\b1\pos(504.428,516.143)}ta {\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:17.05,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fay0.29\fry30\fs30\fnIwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B\c&H76869C&\b1\frz1.654\pos(578.857,540.571)}ma
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:17.05,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fay0.29\fry30\fs30\fnIwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B\c&H76869C&\b1\frz1.654\pos(644,563.428)}ya
Dialogue: 9,0:10:14.03,0:10:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que eu tive que ser filha de quem faz mochi?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:17.05,0:10:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha, olha!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:18.34,0:10:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiz um pro Dera-chan também!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:21.85,0:10:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,O que acha?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:23.34,0:10:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Totalmente elegante, se posso dizer.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:25.06,0:10:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Não ligo.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:26.43,0:10:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 9,0:10:28.67,0:10:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não gosta do festival, Anko?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:31.19,0:10:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Festivais só significam que ficamos super ocupados.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:34.57,0:10:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu costumava...
Dialogue: 9,0:10:39.75,0:10:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Não importa.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:42.15,0:10:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi. {added}
Dialogue: 9,0:10:44.70,0:10:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é o Mochizou.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:46.97,0:10:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Preciso fazer uma coisa agora,
Dialogue: 9,0:10:48.38,0:10:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,então você pode falar com ele por mim?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:50.66,0:10:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tamako! Tamako!
Dialogue: 9,0:10:52.76,0:10:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Câmbio.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:53.60,0:10:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não tá aqui.
Dialogue: 9,0:10:54.88,0:10:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é a Anko?
Dialogue: 9,0:10:56.38,0:10:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Achei que ouvi—
Dialogue: 9,0:10:57.36,0:10:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,É a An!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:00.21,0:11:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou cobrando por ela hoje.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:04.17,0:11:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:05.63,0:11:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum, bom...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:07.52,0:11:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A Tamako vai ver o desfile do santuário no festival? Câmbio.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:12.52,0:11:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Consigo te ouvir do outro lado da rua!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisamos dessas coisas!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:16.26,0:11:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Não grite assim!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:18.30,0:11:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Câmbio.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:19.22,0:11:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é...
Dialogue: 9,0:11:21.17,0:11:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocchi, você vai estar em casa no domingo, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:24.37,0:11:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"Mochizou-san" pra você. Câmbio.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:27.01,0:11:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Não.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:29.64,0:11:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,O Mocchi disse que vai ajudar!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:32.50,0:11:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse é o filho do Ooji.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:34.38,0:11:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele vai roubar nossos segredos.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:36.06,0:11:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,E a família do Mochizou também vai estar ocupada pro festival.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:40.12,0:11:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:41.84,0:11:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele disse que tá de boa em faltar lá se puder \Nfazer mochi com você pro festival, Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:47.07,0:11:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:48.61,0:11:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele claramente quer vir aqui e roubar nossos segredos.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:50.98,0:11:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Você não entende, pai?
Dialogue: 9,0:11:53.35,0:11:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, tenho certeza que ele só quer se juntar pra deixar o festival ainda melhor.
Dialogue: 9,0:11:57.20,0:11:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Você também, vovô?!
Dialogue: 9,0:11:59.61,0:12:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Então que tal isto?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:02.25,0:12:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai pro museu ao meio-dia, né?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:05.79,0:12:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tal acordar cedo e terminar tudo que precisa ser feito antes de ir?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:12.25,0:12:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Então?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:13.57,0:12:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Posso ir então?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:15.59,0:12:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,E as entregas e ajudar o restante do bairro?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:18.50,0:12:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu posso fazer isso. Não se preocupe.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:20.92,0:12:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também! Posso fazer também!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:26.69,0:12:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom, se você diz...
Dialogue: 9,0:12:29.03,0:12:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:29.93,0:12:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas você precisa acordar às 5.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:32.26,0:12:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, eu sei!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:34.39,0:12:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Beleza! Vamos dar tudo pelo festival!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:43.20,0:12:47.20,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\bord7.5\blur4\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&H000000&\3c&H614867&\pos(1031,692)}Tamako {\c&HB6FFFD&}Market
Dialogue: 3,0:12:43.20,0:12:47.20,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\bord7\blur0.7\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&HFEFEFE&\3c&HAA78E4&\pos(1030,690)}Tamako {\c&HB6FFFD&}Market
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.20,0:12:47.20,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&H000000&\pos(1032,694)}Tamako Market
Dialogue: 5,0:12:43.20,0:12:47.20,Logo,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fs5\fscy1100\fscx1100\fad(300,0)\c&HFEFEFE&\pos(1030,690)}Tamako {\c&HB6FFFD&}Market
Dialogue: 9,0:12:43.45,0:12:46.04,Top,,0,0,0,,Tamako Market!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:49.13,0:12:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,É o festival!
Dialogue: 9,0:12:51.43,0:12:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia, Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:52.54,0:12:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, você já acordou?
Dialogue: 9,0:12:54.06,0:12:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim. A Shiori-san também tá aqui.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:56.25,0:12:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 9,0:12:57.65,0:13:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu disse que você podia vir depois das 8...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:00.27,0:13:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Acordei cedo.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:01.94,0:13:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqui está.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:03.54,0:13:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Beleza!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:08.25,0:13:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é boa nisso, Tamako.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:09.93,0:13:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,É só o básico.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:11.87,0:13:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas hoje vamos fazer algo especial.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:14.49,0:13:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,O 'happi mochi' especial da Tamaya!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:16.56,0:13:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Happi?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:17.72,0:13:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, tipo 'happy'!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:19.74,0:13:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Um trocadilho?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:20.76,0:13:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dá pra dizer.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:22.08,0:13:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,O pai disse que tudo bem?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:23.76,0:13:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim. Né, pai?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:25.32,0:13:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Você pode fazer 20 pro seu experimento.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:27.07,0:13:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Viu? 20 mochis de edição limitada!
Dialogue: 9,0:13:30.34,0:13:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Se continuar falando, os mochi podem ficar duros.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:33.26,0:13:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, desculpe.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:35.49,0:13:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Você faz também, Anko.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:37.00,0:13:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem pensar, eu sou ruim nisso.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:39.40,0:13:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro que não.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:40.90,0:13:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu era bem pior que você na sua idade.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:49.27,0:13:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Que música é essa?
Dialogue: 9,0:13:50.75,0:13:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sei lá.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:51.89,0:13:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,É aquela que você fica cantando...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:53.60,0:13:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois é.
Dialogue: 9,0:13:56.85,0:13:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pronto...
Dialogue: 9,0:13:59.63,0:14:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,E...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:12.15,0:14:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso vai ser um problema...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:14.66,0:14:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe! Eu devia ter percebido antes!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:18.12,0:14:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Não é sua culpa.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:22.23,0:14:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas fica estranho sem isso...
Dialogue: 9,0:14:26.05,0:14:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tal isso?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:26.76,0:14:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,É um brinquedo da loja do vovô.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:29.97,0:14:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Quase, mas errou!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:32.89,0:14:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,O que podemos fazer?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:45.63,0:14:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nossa, me sinto bem leve hoje!
Dialogue: 9,0:14:50.31,0:14:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Pega.
Dialogue: 9,0:14:51.12,0:14:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,O que foi isso?
Dialogue: 9,0:14:58.51,0:15:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Esse festival é o dia mais movimentado do ano.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:02.27,0:15:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,E o dia mais tranquilo pra minha loja.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:07.25,0:15:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Este é o mundo e a minha ambivalência.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:11.09,0:15:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa tinta sai com um banho.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:18.35,0:15:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,E aí está o último.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:20.02,0:15:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Você terminou bem rápido.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:22.32,0:15:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,É, tivemos a Shiori-chan nos ajudando este ano.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:25.84,0:15:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos aproveitar o festival ao máximo esta tarde!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:28.63,0:15:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiori-chan, tem tinta no seu nariz!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:33.53,0:15:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também então.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:38.65,0:15:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também!
Dialogue: 9,0:15:44.95,0:15:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko, você não deveria ir logo?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:47.11,0:15:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai lá, a gente dá conta do resto.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:50.07,0:15:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:50.67,0:15:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa sorte.
Dialogue: 9,0:15:55.76,0:15:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Com o quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:15:56.95,0:15:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Então vou indo!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:01.33,0:16:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Não consegui fazer mochi com ela, mas vou provar pra Tamako que ao menos consigo carregar o mikoshi!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:06.30,0:16:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mochizou, dá força!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:08.96,0:16:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Meu ombro dói!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:10.38,0:16:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Para de reclamar igual um velho ranzinza!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:13.41,0:16:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá tão movimentado...
Dialogue: 9,0:16:16.19,0:16:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é a Anko-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:18.69,0:16:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Srta. Florista?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:19.82,0:16:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Graças a Deus, estava te procurando.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:22.21,0:16:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Você poderia nos ajudar?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:24.58,0:16:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Estamos sem mãos suficientes pra vestir as crianças.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:32.81,0:16:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko-chan!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:34.59,0:16:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:35.36,0:16:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode ajudar a ajeitar os ombros desta menina?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:38.83,0:16:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Fique paradinha um pouco, tá?
Dialogue: 9,0:16:44.19,0:16:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Fecha os olhos e conta até dez na sua cabeça.
Dialogue: 9,0:16:55.86,0:16:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pronto, tudo feito!
Dialogue: 9,0:16:58.23,0:16:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Não mexa no rosto.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:01.15,0:17:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Estou estranha. Tira isso!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:04.37,0:17:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas você fica tão fofa!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:06.10,0:17:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fofa?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:07.37,0:17:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Você parece uma princesa.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:09.12,0:17:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:10.00,0:17:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim. Muito fofa!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:12.89,0:17:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ai, não!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:14.61,0:17:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaoru-san, que horas são?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:16.70,0:17:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos ver...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:17.88,0:17:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,11 horas.
Dialogue: 9,0:17:18.78,0:17:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenho que ir!
Dialogue: 9,0:17:20.56,0:17:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Você ia pra algum lugar?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:22.55,0:17:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Você vai sair?
Dialogue: 9,0:17:50.01,0:17:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Acabei não conseguindo ir...
Dialogue: 9,0:17:59.14,0:18:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:02.67,0:18:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunny hop hop!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:04.17,0:18:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunny Mountain!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:11.07,0:18:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela fica tão boba.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:14.35,0:18:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,De que adianta eu desmaiar antes da Tamako chegar?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:22.07,0:18:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha pegar nossos happi mochi, edição limitada só pro festival!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:25.88,0:18:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Voltamos!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:27.75,0:18:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vindos de volta.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:28.76,0:18:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:29.98,0:18:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No fim, não consegui ir.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:32.59,0:18:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério? Que pena!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:37.19,0:18:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá tudo bem, não foi sua culpa.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:40.38,0:18:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,E eu me diverti um pouco também.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:42.39,0:18:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No festival?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:44.31,0:18:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:46.68,0:18:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,É o Mocchi.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:47.94,0:18:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele também tá usando um happi.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:49.30,0:18:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele tava carregando o mikoshi?
Dialogue: 9,0:18:50.98,0:18:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,O coelhinho nas costas dele tá chorando.
Dialogue: 9,0:18:53.20,0:18:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Meio triste...
Dialogue: 9,0:18:55.11,0:18:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sejam todos bem-vindos!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:56.82,0:18:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Experimentem um happy mochi!
Dialogue: 9,0:18:59.85,0:19:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vindos!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:01.75,0:19:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Só durante o festival!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:03.82,0:19:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Só hoje!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:05.96,0:19:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kitashirakawa.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:11.05,0:19:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa tarde.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:12.32,0:19:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Acabamos de voltar.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:14.53,0:19:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele me ouviu gritar agora há pouco!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:21.97,0:19:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:22.66,0:19:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko-chan?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:23.60,0:19:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:25.93,0:19:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:26.95,0:19:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não tá aqui...
Dialogue: 9,0:19:27.74,0:19:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela fugiu pela janela?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:29.24,0:19:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:31.67,0:19:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Uau, uma galinha dourada?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:33.24,0:19:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é algum tipo de presságio?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:35.03,0:19:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Não, é o Dera-chan.
Dialogue: 9,0:19:37.50,0:19:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:42.78,0:19:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:43.78,0:19:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:45.07,0:19:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,O que há?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:46.06,0:19:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nada!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:47.78,0:19:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas—
Dialogue: 9,0:19:48.56,0:19:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Me deixa em paz!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:50.79,0:19:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,O que a gente faz?
Dialogue: 9,0:19:52.07,0:19:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixa comigo!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:53.20,0:19:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso merece um ataque culinário delicioso!
Dialogue: 9,0:19:56.29,0:19:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tal?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:00.35,0:20:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu odeio mochi!
Dialogue: 9,0:20:02.51,0:20:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não gostava quando era pequena?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:04.56,0:20:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela enjoou deles recentemente.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:06.97,0:20:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Então em vez disso...
