Dialogue: 9,0:20:09.22,0:20:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos forçá-la a sair.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:12.37,0:20:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko, desiste e vem pra fora.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:16.31,0:20:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é isso?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:21.83,0:20:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Dera-chan! Você tá bem?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:23.48,0:20:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum... Desculpe invadir...
Dialogue: 9,0:20:26.87,0:20:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Compramos uma lembrancinha pro Kitashirakawa-san...
Dialogue: 9,0:20:31.08,0:20:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hein? Cadê a outra criança?
Dialogue: 9,0:20:33.22,0:20:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Ele teve que ir pro cursinho.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:35.71,0:20:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:36.93,0:20:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Anko, seu amigo está aqui.
Dialogue: 9,0:20:41.19,0:20:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hum, aqui...
Dialogue: 9,0:20:51.79,0:20:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Compramos essa lembrancinha pra você.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:08.83,0:21:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqui.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:18.77,0:21:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Espero que goste.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:21.15,0:21:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,T-T...
Dialogue: 9,0:21:23.99,0:21:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Obrigado!
Dialogue: 9,0:21:26.07,0:21:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Que bom que gostou.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:27.83,0:21:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Espera, foi este?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:29.72,0:21:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece que sim.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:30.62,0:21:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 9,0:21:32.01,0:21:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 9,0:21:34.07,0:21:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A Anko é mesmo uma boa menina.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:42.09,0:21:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo que seus sentimentos ou desejos não se realizem,
Dialogue: 9,0:21:44.50,0:21:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,ou se as coisas não saírem como planejou,
Dialogue: 9,0:21:46.86,0:21:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,em outro caminho nasce outra flor.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ali nasce outra flor.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:51.83,0:21:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, que banho bom.
Dialogue: 9,0:21:54.41,0:23:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{ED} 
